{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Outpost Market Simulator</i>, a first-person market simulator where economic strategy and hardcore survival collide. Your mission: build a fortified outpost from nothing, create a thriving trade hub, and defend it every single night against the creatures that want to tear it all down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Fortress From Scratch</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield your build tool and design your outpost tile-by-tile.\u00a0Every wall, every floor, every turret location is your decision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152400/extras/d535708f7641fcc628d1ab0588e8b5bb.poster.avif?t=1770766780\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152400/extras/d535708f7641fcc628d1ab0588e8b5bb.webm?t=1770766780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152400/extras/d535708f7641fcc628d1ab0588e8b5bb.mp4?t=1770766780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage a Dynamic Market</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not just a survivor; you're a CEO. Stock your shelves with goods, and NPC customers will automatically visit your outpost to shop. But be smart they'll only buy what they want, and they know when a price is too high.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152400/extras/c289c0462670d97c17280e1ffcbafaf7.poster.avif?t=1770766780\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152400/extras/c289c0462670d97c17280e1ffcbafaf7.webm?t=1770766780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152400/extras/c289c0462670d97c17280e1ffcbafaf7.mp4?t=1770766780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive at Night</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the sun goes down, the fight begins. Grab your weapons and defend your base in intense, first-person shooter combat. The richer you get, the harder they'll try to take it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152400/extras/58052b49c5c8f9d7789418437e352f9e.poster.avif?t=1770766780\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152400/extras/58052b49c5c8f9d7789418437e352f9e.webm?t=1770766780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152400/extras/58052b49c5c8f9d7789418437e352f9e.mp4?t=1770766780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend Like a Tycoon</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your profits to engineer the defence. Place walls, turrets, barbed wires, and explosive traps. Funnel the zombies through a deadly maze of your own design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152400/extras/c9f023dbe99e6ceac856835d74e4fd4a.poster.avif?t=1770766780\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152400/extras/c9f023dbe99e6ceac856835d74e4fd4a.webm?t=1770766780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152400/extras/c9f023dbe99e6ceac856835d74e4fd4a.mp4?t=1770766780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4152400?t=1770766780","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4152400?t=1770766780","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152400/64bbd2735169ceb5ca77ff2b5c48a27f2ae7d3cd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770766780","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152400/64bbd2735169ceb5ca77ff2b5c48a27f2ae7d3cd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770766780","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152400/extras/6f2d095355a8316fae4bd228dbbfccf4.avif?t=1770766780\" width=1080 height=1920 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Outpost Market Simulator</i>, a first-person market simulator where economic strategy and hardcore survival collide. Your mission: build a fortified outpost from nothing, create a thriving trade hub, and defend it every single night against the creatures that want to tear it all down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Fortress From Scratch</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield your build tool and design your outpost tile-by-tile.\u00a0Every wall, every floor, every turret location is your decision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152400/extras/d535708f7641fcc628d1ab0588e8b5bb.poster.avif?t=1770766780\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152400/extras/d535708f7641fcc628d1ab0588e8b5bb.webm?t=1770766780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152400/extras/d535708f7641fcc628d1ab0588e8b5bb.mp4?t=1770766780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage a Dynamic Market</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not just a survivor; you're a CEO. Stock your shelves with goods, and NPC customers will automatically visit your outpost to shop. But be smart they'll only buy what they want, and they know when a price is too high.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152400/extras/c289c0462670d97c17280e1ffcbafaf7.poster.avif?t=1770766780\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152400/extras/c289c0462670d97c17280e1ffcbafaf7.webm?t=1770766780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152400/extras/c289c0462670d97c17280e1ffcbafaf7.mp4?t=1770766780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive at Night</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the sun goes down, the fight begins. Grab your weapons and defend your base in intense, first-person shooter combat. The richer you get, the harder they'll try to take it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152400/extras/58052b49c5c8f9d7789418437e352f9e.poster.avif?t=1770766780\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152400/extras/58052b49c5c8f9d7789418437e352f9e.webm?t=1770766780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152400/extras/58052b49c5c8f9d7789418437e352f9e.mp4?t=1770766780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend Like a Tycoon</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your profits to engineer the defence. Place walls, turrets, barbed wires, and explosive traps. Funnel the zombies through a deadly maze of your own design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152400/extras/c9f023dbe99e6ceac856835d74e4fd4a.poster.avif?t=1770766780\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152400/extras/c9f023dbe99e6ceac856835d74e4fd4a.webm?t=1770766780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152400/extras/c9f023dbe99e6ceac856835d74e4fd4a.mp4?t=1770766780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Overload Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152400/8f42e157071469bd7cea6ccbabf10a31e8dd42b5/header.jpg?t=1770766780","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.stea